user: How much does extra internet cost?
----- TOOL TRACE -----
[1] tool: search_billing_documentation
    input: {"query":"extra internet price block"}
    result: {"document":"Mobile_Provider_Billing_Guide.md","documentId":"MOB-BILLING-2026-01","query":"extra internet price block","matches":[{"section":"8.1","heading":"What is the cost of extra internet?","parentHeading":"Frequently asked questions","text":"Each additional 10 GB block beyond 20 GB costs $10. Partially used blocks are rounded up. See Section 3.2.","score":6.478},{"section":"4.3","heading":"Worked example","parentHeading":"Bill calculation","text":"A subscriber uses **1,350 phone minutes** and **35 GB** of internet in a month. Phone: $10 for one extra 1,000-minute block. Internet: $50 base + $20 for two additional 10 GB blocks. **Total = $80**.","score":4.671},{"section":"3.2","heading":"Additional internet blocks","parentHeading":"Internet pricing","text":"Each additional **10 GB block** costs **$10**. A partially used additional block is charged as a full block. For example, 20 GB costs $50; 21 GB costs $60; 30 GB costs $60; 35 GB costs $70.","score":4.17},{"section":"2.2","heading":"Additional minutes","parentHeading":"Phone call pricing","text":"Each **additional 1,000-minute block** costs **$10**. A partially used additional block is charged as a full block. For example, 1,001 minutes costs $10 in phone charges; 2,001 minutes costs $20.","score":2.907}],"note":"Keyword (BM25) search over the indexed guide; cite results as §<section>."}
final answer: Extra internet costs **$10** for each additional **10 GB block** beyond the included 20 GB (Guide §3.2, §8.1). 

Please note that any partially used additional block is rounded up and charged as a full block (e.g., using 21 GB costs an extra $10, totaling $60 for internet) (Guide §3.2).
