  * **Internet:** 18 GB used ($50 base charge for up to 20 GB) (Guide §3.1, §4.2).

* **October 2026 ($80 total):**
  * **Phone:** 1,350 minutes used. This exceeded the 1,000-minute included allowance by 350 minutes, resulting in one extra 1,000-minute block charge of **$10** (Guide §2.2, §4.2).
  * **Internet:** 35 GB used. This exceeded the 20 GB base allowance by 15 GB, resulting in two additional 10 GB blocks (charged as full blocks) for an extra **$20**, bringing the internet charge to **$70** ($50 base + $20 extra) (Guide §3.2, §4.2).

There are no taxes, activation fees, or other service charges (Guide §4.2).
